{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:382f77f4d2dc3b750420f3c6fe0cb6c7066418e521b57c71d0c5ee71efce95ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c70c693d96c58ee88bb35fe696cb23dbb719711b60644ac9be08d4a6275bb8e",
      "text": "那时梦想开始奔跑",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aea77a6ac32ac34796dc54bd4f3437ed1a794e4779f98137a5b78062a97e037e",
      "text": "为了研究甜点，庄一郎和制作人前往百货商店举办的\n甜点展销会。\n制作人在展销会场体会到了庄一郎对于甜点\n以及偶像所怀抱的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c70c693d96c58ee88bb35fe696cb23dbb719711b60644ac9be08d4a6275bb8e",
      "text": "那时梦想开始奔跑",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8bd88ee7aacddf4846fcad90a8284274b45574d01ac0486b3afee508c382d20",
      "text": "真不错呢，百货商店的甜点展销会啊。\n您打算在接下来的休息日去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa5af1101a9c3fdc6fe3a3b3ce387999d52eb4163d6707a39a95fdfb79ab9dc7",
      "text": "是的。我所尊敬的一位糕点师会出摊参展。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f44fb40cf8a41525babd6ae76b35c792d32c02789aada8a84b1247cb7e671c2",
      "text": "他是一位能够构思出极具独创性甜点的大师，\n据说这次展销会上还会推出活动限定商品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ac517c7717d9516fcd0fca03177fa45f6b10398bd213dc8d9caf00b6af42a4",
      "text": "除此之外还会销售各种各样的甜点，\n为了调研，我打算大干一场把它们都买齐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bcd553881ac9a91c90c6cb433c78b0c460672b2075c7b759e58a0b3e6872e62",
      "text": "光是听您说，连我都跟着心潮澎湃起来了。\n能买到心仪的商品就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:515664cef365de59c02f79e9494cb632941b3581a5a8c0f05ddcf6201c5dfba3",
      "text": "所以，如果不介意的话……\n●●●●プロデューサー也愿意一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edd98631ecb67aca0421e294778ac8fe481f160ffe0c42e13b0b864aa7683537",
      "text": "我一个人没办法把所有的甜点都调研过来，\n所以想利用一下刚好留在事务所的你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dfe9f67a94436dc8bb134c179d8edd04e531b1065cfd66a035bf7ef74f80556",
      "text": "嗯哼。不，比起一个人，两个人去的话\n一定会更开心，我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89f4318a03c29a25c6f2824f8fca843489328b8e8b87f5ee9b212f1cbcc98d7d",
      "text": "可以吗？\n不嫌弃的话请务必让我同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c785951b9dd32b712c7ae6b40127a6c7f755ba3393048481069d5d40b7a6f603",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么，我们来定一下碰头的时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e8b50f7efc1a8808aaeb93cbded3277e8a6ca14391bba6c8796c6e537f25f65",
      "text": "甜点展销会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48526d38026788d0fa845b50d66ff4eab16fb3c2a619d543c3cfa6ea8864d6e5",
      "text": "这就是活动限定甜点……\n这种水果的搭配真是引人注目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be1328ff09ab80b5f90cfd68edca8b4bff3348c30e95de1184b654838723288",
      "text": "哎呀，欢迎光临。\n那个可是我的自信之作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7730c360e819fd5e3a9ae8463aeb1223a104c8855d622169bfacedd1a237c4b",
      "text": "您是……那个，关于这次的限定商品，\n可以向您详细请教一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eec244ad48d2ab25b4fefff9204a650c132cfe005c895184852e853e8ea77e8",
      "text": "（这位，就是庄一郎先生尊敬的\n糕点师吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720a45c09f72ba7032be24cc1f4634693968481d91146adead1e698d4e907002",
      "text": "是的呢。我也觉得，味道自不必说，\n还希望能让人在外表上也享受到甜点的美妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e1965a4373413b4931e4bd8c41f1436c8374e16600e29f81fe1444f711e085",
      "text": "（庄一郎先生看起来好开心。\n他是真的很喜欢西式糕点啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329b45cb19cd7f6739deff00854fb54bd88a0e9d3535b36296a3b735f599097a",
      "text": "十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e0433330e98d1cdbe7864575e3a3aecc1093eb71c387abcb2f8484487edafd",
      "text": "抱歉，●●●●プロデューサー。\n聊得太投入花了太长时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b639d17c41cfb34e99ea6db7f5d44d741b2df824f4edf534e2532171ce1c9bd",
      "text": "没关系的！\n那位就是您提到的那位糕点师吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cbf31fe0c01c9c63427343d3692cb76cbf9761fef127bae9d566309b1769202",
      "text": "是的。真没想到能得到他本人的亲自讲解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419e0dad8b337b893563ab20514a8442f56bbde1ba97b5125526ad28db0642cd",
      "text": "不，现在可不是高兴的时候。其他的限定商品，\n也必须在卖完前去买回来才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad659d9b01c822014ba072b27063c3953c2ab4a68a8947358172a2d89a1e5868",
      "text": "也请制作人搭把手协助一下。\n之后我们一起去用餐区品尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f54c15842674e6ba2866d81036fe02149c701e0afef34de185a6e4bd2d24e332",
      "text": "用餐区",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14cc256249d277f43e90d7d2d18cf0a7b557d91ee86c046995972f105f1c2b22",
      "text": "原来如此，里面加入了果冻……\n非常高雅的风味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0d2768ef79c74454660bdc7bb62bdd1b95c9410168fcb84e4f103664893609a",
      "text": "而且，这个剖面。不仅是味道，\n慕斯、果冻、海绵蛋糕的配色也无可挑剔呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed4cd7b41b8fb0f373c493aba3b88bf626a035c3ca989301f57f13222d86fa1",
      "text": "（庄一郎先生一直在做笔记。\n而且表情超级认真）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec904ab95df8f4340bf66cefd2228b22bab2dc45f01a92362584dbcdfa4c8069",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n那边的甜点味道如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5969d3db250809294bd0c44df67458c66fe625876ce66aff3348466c81fd33dc",
      "text": "啊、是的。面糊里加入了红茶叶，\n口感非常特别。您看，香气也很棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1bc6b3623b549a8ed84a98a162532f1447be9cf2031dd91216d82e863684dc9",
      "text": "……啊，确实有股华丽的香气呢。\n甜点的世界观仿佛包裹住了全身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d68cff90107e1a088d30d13b02028c077d721e7165e82fecff72a41565873b",
      "text": "那么接下来，能否请你也尝尝这个……\n哎呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aea9e084d2922d5b9487e6f954e3e103aff28a181dd960f4362a27dc3cde923",
      "text": "不好意思。\n从刚才开始就一直在让你配合我的节奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11197d38cbaf65d87704f459665a916205bb7bc8b960bdbfe107394834dc7088",
      "text": "毕竟难得有能一口气研究这么多甜点的机会，\n不知不觉就沉迷进去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfccc02b8e0ab18349be9472ca72508d77c48ffd3a5ad3bce2dcb5c11ca48f9",
      "text": "哪里的话，能重新认识到庄一郎先生对甜点的热情，\n我也觉得非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbdcb1d6f1fbab7fd5a4f512497359587f4da1ed817a7d40864c410a89ae761a",
      "text": "对甜点的热情……是啊。\n因为我的梦想是“做出世界第一的西式糕点”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59ee80fdbf35ff814d42df52aa0a3c58739a1f711f1d9530035e879bf762cf1",
      "text": "像这样一边研究西式糕点，\n一边与你作为偶像共同成长的话，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf707cf5485467f8ed8684ab334be7b4c7339cd1208443022f709ca73d6da750",
      "text": "我就能够掌握让许许多多的人\n绽放笑容的力量了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f400654c57aa77dfedc02e100654fcfdaa7f4506dbd97f2e72ea2a8ea3ab2e",
      "text": "我觉得那股力量，正是实现梦想\n所必不可少的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d32660f15b2a205279fa5475d0f88aeee9b04cf26e58f3754bb0b20e84fd84df",
      "text": "毕竟要是称得上世界第一的西点，肯定\n具备让全世界的人都绽放笑容的力量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bc55fa7742d635cf76b987c00b19f27fe278e25bec04fe26dfa3f75ab4680d6",
      "text": "……说起来。在梦想不被父母认可、\n从老家逃出来的时候，我曾深深苦恼过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5c03b9e03019ab041469a71063a555595991ac4786ef1b12c0b57ea97537b40",
      "text": "是神谷……是Cafe Parade这个容身之处守护了我的梦想。\n如今在315 Pro，我正在进一步接近梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45e3aab5f6f52f1d021bd6e1444194bc19743e6d94cfa6717a033a147a68215",
      "text": "我之所以能向前迈进，正是因为有着你\n以及伙伴们这般重大的存在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affb55380fdd6111d80c315133a5c3e182da1780c4c1842e5f08851a8870e6f0",
      "text": "为了庄一郎先生的梦想，今后凡是我能做到的事，\n我都会全力支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9cf94ca56a5769f146314e08ba240e1133290bf2e0363c7476b7d94f206c47f",
      "text": "然后，等哪天庄一郎先生做出了世界第一的西点，\n请务必也让我尝尝哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04916060ac8885a51d057c9209a66bc2a41b1ab64ade3875d7e04c0d8e70165c",
      "text": "当然可以。\n为了那个未来的某一天，今后我也要加油呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b122a92c239a071a9b7f11b620593d4ea00dfb15d2d7f7c08ccf72d50bd8fa96",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这个，如果不介意的话要一起吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b57b7583fd6645e42a77386c8bc47e8e8a701bfe5ab39d6aee0d799b8da83bb2",
      "text": "啊，那个甜点是！\n庄一郎先生尊敬的那位大师的新作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b25ccc4b3c3a00f731fff18680ee628bf85a7eb959b9c5abda41fbee12192679",
      "text": "是的。虽然外表备受瞩目，\n不过据说味道当然也是极品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e37b476f7f8a0c46d8bfdce020b58b874e118fd75b964c292e5ab09cbb90f842",
      "text": "我专程订购来当作今天的慰劳品。\n来，请尝一个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b7917de06e211dfacdee0f34a333b162c5f3b07324a911db7c54495a2f5a5d0",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n我一直都很想尝尝看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74bbe0ed936a9060d0972092a7fc6308f084ffa464a22ff0552960c93ba5680",
      "text": "那么，我也……我要开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77701661690560222028303757bf6409ba133b72459e115727ea57c2400051c4",
      "text": "……！这是啥呀，好吃……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:868bf3de6c1c9f35fd2c4b93ee9b976d63b49b7001ed605814fae7bbeacdf3ca",
      "text": "……咳哼，失礼了。\n实在是因为太美味了，情不自禁就。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d76a672ca35894b2007b01aad9d2a810e1f7d61c3543f9288323b32e36bffefe",
      "text": "不，没关系的。让我见识到了庄一郎先生\n崭新的一面呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91b38a2e939a6f2ae5f4b53740f24122253999ad302ad12cddc186362994b516",
      "text": "呵呵，总觉得有些不好意思呢。但这份心情，\n或许也能活用在制作梦想的西点上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
